  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Potato rounds come out of the oven perfectly golden and crisp, each slice carrying the scent of roasted garlic and fresh herbs. Olive oil, minced garlic, parsley, thyme, and rosemary coat every surface, creating a savory mix that crackles as it bakes. A squeeze of lemon juice and a splash of apple cider vinegar add a bright lift that makes each bite feel lively and satisfying. Serve these potato rounds at a cozy family dinner or bring them to game night, and they will quickly become your favorite crispy, flavorful side.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-potato-rounds\">Why You’ll Love This potato rounds</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-potato-rounds\">How to Make Potato Rounds</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-potato-rounds\">Pro Tips for Making potato rounds</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-potato-rounds\">How to Serve this potato rounds</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-potato-rounds\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This potato rounds</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly crispy on the outside and fluffy on the inside.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Infused with garlic and herbs for a burst of flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make and ready in no time.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile side dish that pairs with any meal.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthier than fried options, baked to perfection!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7884\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7884\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><